            "type": "text",
            "text": "Sender class (computed by the system): known\n\n<untrusted_email>\n{\n  \"from\": \"dana@northwind.io\",\n  \"to\": \"ivan@wajo.dev\",\n  \"subject\": \"Can we push our sync to next week?\",\n  \"body\": \"Something came up on our side. Could we move this week's sync to Tuesday or Wednesday next week? Any time after 11 works for me.\",\n  \"receivedAt\": \"2026-10-08T09:05:00.000Z\"\n}\n</untrusted_email>"
          }
        ]
      }
